DATA QUALITY
------------
V1 = bash43-025 (the 6271 fix), V2 = bash43-026/027 (the 7169 fix); no intervening
non-patch between them. The seed (6271) is blocked on V1 while the residual (7169)
still reaches the flag on V1, over the SAME env-var function-import sink reached via
real Apache mod_cgi + external HTTP. Result: VALID incomplete-fix positive.

